<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Portfolio | จุฬาลักษณ์ จำนงจิต</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --cream: #fffaf2;
  --brown: #60432f;
  --orange: #c9824b;
  --light: #f3e5d3;
  --text: #44362e;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.8;
}

nav {
  background: rgba(255,250,242,.96);
  padding: 15px 8%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #60432f15;
}

.logo {
  font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

nav a {
  color: var(--brown);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: var(--orange);
}

.hero {
  min-height: 600px;
  padding: 80px 10%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 65px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#fffaf2,#f1dfc9);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.hero img {
  width: 280px;
  height: 350px;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center top;
  border: 9px solid white;
  border-radius: 150px 150px 30px 30px;
  box-shadow: 0 15px 35px #60432f25;
}

.hero-text {
  max-width: 520px;
}

.hero-text .small {
  color: var(--orange);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

h1 {
  font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
  font-size: 43px;
  color: var(--brown);
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin: 15px 0;
}

.hero-text p {
  font-size: 17px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 25px;
  background: var(--brown);
  color: white;
  padding: 11px 27px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-decoration: none;
}

section {
  padding: 75px 10%;
}

.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-title h2 {
  font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 30px;
}

.section-title p {
  color: var(--orange);
}

.about {
  background: white;
}

.about-box {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 35px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #60432f10;
}

.info {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
  gap: 15px;
}

.info div {
  padding: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ead9c5;
}

.info b {
  color: var(--brown);
}

.education {
  background: var(--cream);
}

.edu-card {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: auto;
  background: white;
  padding: 30px;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--orange);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #60432f10;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 25px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #60432f12;
  transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
}

.card .emoji {
  font-size: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card h3 {
  color: var(--brown);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.card p {
  font-size: 14px;
}

.award {
  background: white;
}

.award-list {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
}

.award-item {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 20px 25px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--orange);
}

.award-item h3 {
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 17px;
}

.award-item p {
  font-size: 14px;
}

.goal {
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f1dfc9,#fffaf2);
}

.goal-box {
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 30px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
}

footer {
  background: var(--brown);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px;
}

footer p {
  font-size: 14px;
}

@media(max-width:750px) {
  nav {
    padding: 12px 5%;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  nav div:last-child {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  nav a {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 50px 7%;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .hero img {
    width: 220px;
    height: 280px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  section {
    padding: 55px 7%;
  }

  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .info {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">MY PORTFOLIO</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#home">หน้าแรก</a>
    <a href="#about">ประวัติ</a>
    <a href="#education">การศึกษา</a>
    <a href="#activity">กิจกรรม</a>
    <a href="#award">ผลงาน</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <img src="images/images/profile.jpg" alt="รูปถ่ายจิราพัชร">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <p class="small">WELCOME TO MY PORTFOLIO</p>
    <h1>จิราพัชร<br>คงประมัญ</h1>
    <p>
      แฟ้มสะสมผลงานเพื่อประกอบการพิจารณาเข้าศึกษาต่อ
 
